# MERCATOR, trade: the market at JAKEL, then the chart in flight and a jump to DRILO.
# Run: pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 2000 --script mercator-trade.script
# (from boards/desktop). MERCATOR's starting settings (2026-11-23): 60 pictures a second,
# the CHASE view and DETAIL HIGH; the scene plays at those and changes no setting.

# Home screen: seven steps right, from BENCH to MERCATOR, then start it.
5 press right
6 release right
8 press right
9 release right
11 press right
12 release right
14 press right
15 release right
17 press right
18 release right
20 press right
21 release right
23 press right
24 release right
32 press south
33 release south

100 press south          # PLAY: docked at JAKEL (FORGE, TECH 5, SECURE)
101 release south

# The market: ORE, one tonne, then A held: the buying speeds up until the stock runs out.
160 press down           # MARKET line
161 release down
190 press south          # open the market
191 release south
230 press down           # ICE
231 release down
260 press down           # ORE
261 release down
300 press south          # buy 1 t
301 release south
340 press south          # held: 8 t in all, NONE LEFT HERE
430 release south
480 press east           # back to the dock screen
481 release east

# Launch and fly out past 5 km (no jump closer to the station).
500 press up             # LAUNCH line
501 release up
520 press south          # launch
521 release south
560 press west           # faster, to top speed
1100 release west

# The chart in flight: look at two systems, zoom out to the whole Lens and back, jump.
1540 press minus         # SELECT: the chart, JAKEL in the middle
1541 release minus
1580 press right         # DRILO, HAVEN QUIET, 2.7 LY
1581 release right
1620 press right         # XICRA, MINE RISKY, 5.1 LY
1621 release right
1660 press west          # X: the whole Lens
1661 release west
1720 press west          # X: near again
1721 release west
1760 press left          # DRILO
1761 release left
1800 press south         # A: JUMP TO DRILO; ARRIVED at about 1880
1801 release south
